      "created_at": "2018-08-26T21:30:04.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"MigrantP\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/48/1921_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MigrantP:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Immunity should not count. If that is happening in the digital version, it's a bug. Moving Target specifically lists 3 mechanisms and only those 3 mechanisms count.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Meter Storm made Stuntman immune in my game and I was prompted to use a power with Stuntman. Unfortunately, I chose skip and there's no indication in the game log that I had the the option to use a power.</p>",
