      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>I would think that immunity counts as prevented. A villian target targets stuntman for damage the damage is prevented as stuntman is immune to damage.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I do have a related question to moving target, it says &quot;When stuntman is dealt damage by a villain target, destroy this card and use a power.&quot; I was in a game with fixed point in time in play and when he took damage nothing happened. I wasn&#39;t sure if the card destruction was tied to the power use, but the game&nbsp;<span id=\"docs-internal-guid-8ddd2b18-7fff-3cf3-5bc1-201390e95804\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Trebuchet MS&quot;; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; white-space: pre-wrap;\">interrupted </span></span>it that way.</p>",
